  "notes": "sharepresentation uploads a document (not pasted text). Clicking Upload opens the login modal when logged out; then 'Sign in with Google' (a[href*=\"google/redirect\"]) starts Google OAuth. After sign-in the site redirects to /upload (form #upload_form). The file input is #file_uploading; selecting a file auto-fills the title field #filename (name=file_name) with the filename and then ENABLES the once-disabled fields, so title/description/tags/category all run with a wait-for-enabled guard and title is overwritten last with the real blog title. Tags use Bootstrap tokenfield — each tag typed into #tags-tokenfield then Enter. Category is select#category_values. The Publish button is #submit; on success the site redirects to /dashboard where the just-published presentation appears as a .view-ppt link, from which the published URL is captured. Content mode is 'document' so the collector asks for a Document URL instead of a blog textarea.",
